Fork of p_5f9b, triggered by the object_19 claim (receptacle_8, 21-24h) going against 2 more times since the last call (now 1 for, 3 against total). The parent's core thesis—that the evening wind-down moves desk items to bedrooms (receptacle_8) and kitchen items to the side shelf (receptacle_19)—is failing on three of its four specific evening predictions: object_19→receptacle_8 (1 for, 3 against), object_15→receptacle_19 (1 for, 4 against), object_25→receptacle_21 (1 for, 2 against). The per-object evidence confirms: object_15 is at receptacle_4 on 7/8 sighted days (it does NOT get put away), and object_19 is not at receptacle_19 during work hours (0 found, 5 empty looks).

