The pattern observed:
- object_3 (normally receptacle_7) → receptacle_11 at 21:00 (the entryway/key area)
- object_7 (normally receptacle_19) → receptacle_3 at 21:00
- object_10 (normally receptacle_19) → receptacle_7 at 21:00 (the living room shelf)
- object_14 (normally receptacle_12) → receptacle_7 at 21:00 (the living room shelf)
- object_17 (normally receptacle_12) → receptacle_10 at 21:00 (the living room area)
